The game is full of action, a lot of shooting and fun.
Pros:
+ Several weapons, so it is not only one thing that you do to kill;
+ The game has details, beautiful images, small stuff around and you can explode some of them;
+ Cool story, with some twists;
Cons:
- Some repeated enemies,minions;
- Some secrets are really hard to get because of the design of the path, you need to look back to check if you missed things;
- Jumps are terrible, perhaps it is just with me, but 3 places in the game that required just a simple jump were really hard to execute;
So, I recommend the game, it is a good FPS.

